<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line" lang="en">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">KaVa: Latent Reasoning via 
<br class="ltx_break">Compressed KV-Cache Distillation<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>Qualcomm AI Research is an initiative of Qualcomm Technologies, Inc.</span></span></span></h1>
