<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>KV-Cache cosine similarity between the latent CoT and the ground-truth CoT</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We investigate the similarity between the KV-cache representing the latent CoT and the KV-cache of the ground-truth CoT. Figures <a href="#A4.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ Appendix D KV-Cache cosine similarity between the latent CoT and the ground-truth CoT ‣ KaVa: Latent Reasoning via Compressed KV-Cache Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> and <a href="#S5.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ 5.2 Teacher-Student KV-Cache Correspondence ‣ 5 Interpretability of Latent Reasoning Traces ‣ KaVa: Latent Reasoning via Compressed KV-Cache Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> present the similarities averaged over layers and heads, while figures <a href="#A4.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix D KV-Cache cosine similarity between the latent CoT and the ground-truth CoT ‣ KaVa: Latent Reasoning via Compressed KV-Cache Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, <a href="#A4.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ Appendix D KV-Cache cosine similarity between the latent CoT and the ground-truth CoT ‣ KaVa: Latent Reasoning via Compressed KV-Cache Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>, <a href="#A4.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ Appendix D KV-Cache cosine similarity between the latent CoT and the ground-truth CoT ‣ KaVa: Latent Reasoning via Compressed KV-Cache Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>, and <a href="#A4.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ Appendix D KV-Cache cosine similarity between the latent CoT and the ground-truth CoT ‣ KaVa: Latent Reasoning via Compressed KV-Cache Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> show the similarities in individual heads and layers.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.F8" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.02312v1/Student_vs_GT_Values.png" id="A4.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:274/158;" width="274" height="158" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.02312v1/Student_vs_GT_Values_After_Eviction.png" id="A4.F8.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:220/195;" width="220" height="195" alt="Refer to caption"></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Cosine similarity of Values in the latent CoT with Values of the ground truth averaged across heads and layers. We use the same prompt and ground truth CoT as in Table <a href="#S5.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 5.1 Decoding the Latent Trace ‣ 5 Interpretability of Latent Reasoning Traces ‣ KaVa: Latent Reasoning via Compressed KV-Cache Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.F9" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.02312v1/Student_vs_GT_Keys_-_Detailed_all_heads_layers.png" id="A4.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:384/768;" width="384" height="768" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>Cosine similarity between Keys in the latent CoT and Keys of the ground truth across layers.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.F10" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.02312v1/Student_vs_GT_Values_-_Detailed_all_heads_layers.png" id="A4.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:368/731;" width="368" height="731" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>Cosine similarity between Values in the latent CoT and Values of the ground truth across layers.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.02312v1/Student_vs_GT_Keys_After_Eviction_-_Detailed_all_heads_layers.png" id="A4.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:384/778;" width="384" height="778" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>Cosine similarity between Keys in the latent CoT and Keys of the ground truth after eviction across layers.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.F12" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.02312v1/Student_vs_GT_Values_After_Eviction_-_Detailed_all_heads_layers.png" id="A4.F12.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:384/773;" width="384" height="773" alt="Refer to caption">
