<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>
Prompt: “Jon runs a website where he gets paid for every person who visits. He gets paid $0.10 for every person who visits. Each hour he gets 50 visits. His website operates 24 hours a day. How many dollars does he make in a 30 day month?”.
<span id="A5.T7.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">T6</span> – <span id="A5.T7.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">T11</span> stand for <span id="A5.T7.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣gets</span>, <span id="A5.T7.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣makes</span>, <span id="A5.T7.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣operates</span>, <span id="A5.T7.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣visits</span>, <span id="A5.T7.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣hourly</span>, and <span id="A5.T7.18" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣hour</span> respectively. Tokens 16-24 are omitted due to low semantic content.
</figcaption>
</figure>
