<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>
Prompt: “Raine’s house is just a walking distance from her school. It takes her 150 steps to walk to the school. How many steps does she take walking to and from school in five days?”.
<span id="A5.T8.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">T11</span> – <span id="A5.T8.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">T18</span> stand for <span id="A5.T8.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣walking</span>, <span id="A5.T8.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣footsteps</span>, <span id="A5.T8.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣walks</span>, <span id="A5.T8.18" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣walk</span>, <span id="A5.T8.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣but</span>, <span id="A5.T8.20" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">This</span>, <span id="A5.T8.21" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣steps</span>, and <span id="A5.T8.22" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">␣going</span> respectively.
</figcaption>
</figure>
